.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK MILESTONE EDIT"
.SH NAME
hamstik milestone edit \- Edit a milestone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik milestone edit [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Edit a milestone
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I ID
Milestone id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --name
New name
.TP
.B --description
New description text
.TP
.B --description-file
New description source (path, or - for stdin)
.TP
.B --description-editor
Author the description in $VISUAL/$EDITOR instead of passing text
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --clear-description
Clear the description
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --owner
New milestone owner: me, a user UUID, a public ID (usr_...), or `none`
.TP
.B --target-date
New target date
.TP
.B --clear-target-date
Clear the target date
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --reason
Why the milestone changed (recorded in events)
.TP
.B --force
Bypass revision conflict protection (If-Match: *)
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
